    <section id="problems">
      <h2>Common problems and fixes</h2>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary>It says no video was found</summary>
          <p>Make sure the link is for a video pin. Image pins, boards and profiles will not work. Try opening the pin again and copying the link once more.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>The short pin.it link does not work</summary>
          <p>Open the link in your browser first. Then copy the full address from the address bar and paste that instead.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>The download does not start</summary>
          <p>Check your internet connection and try again. On a phone, make sure your browser is allowed to download files. Try another browser, such as Chrome or Safari.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>I cannot find the video after downloading</summary>
          <p>On Android, look in the Downloads folder or the Files app. On iPhone, open the Files app and check the Downloads folder. On a computer, open your browser's download list.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>The video quality is low</summary>
          <p>The download has the same quality as the video on Pinterest. If the creator uploaded a low quality video, the download will look the same.</p>
        </details>
      </div>

